"送出去的只有你正在看的對話裡最近 20 則訊息、聊天室名稱和發言人名字：判斷送到 TypeSafe（承諾不拿來訓練模型），寫回覆送到 OpenRouter，而且只轉給不保留、不訓練的供應商。聊天內容不會存在這台 Mac 上，紀錄檔只記時間、次數和花費。" = "Only the last 20 messages of the chat you're looking at, the chat's name and the senders' names are sent: to TypeSafe for reading (it commits not to train on them) and to OpenRouter for drafts, routed only to providers that neither keep nor train on them. Chats are not stored on this Mac; the log holds only times, counts and costs.";
